  description: "Activate this Skill during your Main Phase. Shuffle your entire hand
    into the Deck, then add 1 Level 11 monster from your Deck to your hand, and if
    you do, you can Special Summon up to 2 Level 7 monsters with different Attributes
    from your Deck and/or GY, but their ATK/DEF become 0, also their effects are
    negated. While you control \"Gate Guardian\", it gains the following effect.\r\n\u25CF
    Once while face-up on the field, when this card is targeted for an attack: You
    can change the attacking monster's ATK to 0, until the end of the Damage Step."
